[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Attack the enemy positions marked on the map. Destroy their defenses and capture the positions.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Description]
The enemy positions in this valley are guarding the main transport corridor, which connects their eastern and western forces. You must capture the enemy positions marked on the map.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Attack the enemy positions marked on the map. Destroy their defenses and repel all enemy counterattacks.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Description]
According to reconnaissance, an enemy advance party has captured the village marked on the map. Reclaim it before the enemy has a chance to replenish their strength and establish their defenses. While attacking, maintain your reconnaissance - and watch out for approaching enemy reserves.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
Our advance party, which is comprised of infantry and self-propelled artillery, has cut off the enemy’s main transport corridor. We must hold the captured positions, and prevent the enemy from restoring their supply lines.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
Our advance party, which is comprised of infantry and self-propelled artillery, has cut off the enemy’s main transport corridor. We must hold the captured positions, and prevent the enemy from restoring their supply lines.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture and hold the village

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
Quick-march to the village marked on the map. Establish your defenses there, and hold it for the designated period of time, until the main body of our forces arrives.

